{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>LiftLoggr 是一款為重量訓練而設的記錄工具，主張操練期間不被打擾，每組動作只需點一下圓圈即可完成記錄，並提供暖身清單、自動休息計時器、Apple Watch 同步與離線備份。適合不希望在同一組與下一組之間忙於填表的重訓愛好者。原價 US $0.99，現正限時免費。</p>\n<img alt=\"限時免費\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/460x460Icon-Ap-SiOS01-75-2.webp\">\n<h2>點一下圓圈即完成記錄</h2>\n<p>打開 App 即見今日課表，每組動作只需點一下圓圈即可完成記錄。內置 378 個動作並可按肌群與器材篩選，亦支援自訂動作。暖身清單與自動休息計時器會在鎖定畫面與動態島倒數，可即時加時或跳過。Apple Watch 同步顯示組數與休息時間，心率及熱量會寫入 Apple Health；系統同時自動偵測個人最佳成績並估算 1RM。</p>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1320x2868bb-246-scaled.jpg\">\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1320x2868bb-247-scaled.jpg\">\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1320x2868bb-248-scaled.jpg\">\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1320x2868bb-249-scaled.jpg\">\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1320x2868bb-250-scaled.jpg\">\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1320x2868bb-251-scaled.jpg\">\n<ul>\n<li>應用名稱：LiftLoggr</li>\n<li>應用類別：Health &amp; Fitness</li>\n<li>下載位置：App Store</li>\n</ul>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-20T12:04:06.956798+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":363,"images":7,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-19T22:28:50+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-20T17:37:35.810740+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-20T11:58:15.423145+00:00","content_hash":"3cd7ac142510f92e36990d214a56aa87ca4d5cc80071696d810bae91e2bc99c6","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}